            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe asosele kuli Mose ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.27+NUM.15.28+NUM.15.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 15:27-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Eba abena Israeli ukuti, ‘Ngo muntu umo abifya mukukanaishiba, acita ifyo Yawe alesha mu mafunde yakwe, mukalekonka ifi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“‘Nga ni shimapepo uwasubwa ewacita ubu bubifi no kulenga na bambi abantu balebifya, alingilefye ukuleta iciponti kuli Yawe no kufuta umulandu onse. Alingile ukuleta icabula akalema ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi acita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalete uyu cilume wa ŋombe ku mpongolo ye Tenti Lyakukumaninamo pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Ali nokutambalika ukuboko kwakwe pa mutwe wa ciponti no kucipaila pa menso yakwa Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo shimapepo uwasubwa na mafuta, ali nokusendako umulopa umo uwa cilume wa ŋombe nokutwala mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natumpike umunwe mu mulopa no kukana imiku cine lubali pa cinso cakwa Yawe kuntanshi ya cisalu icicinga ku cifulo camushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo shimapepo akashinge umulopa ku nsengo sha bulambo bocelapo ububani ubwanunka ubusaka, ubwaba mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo pa cinso cakwa Yawe. Kabili umulopa onse uwashalapo uwakwa cilume wa ŋombe, shimapepo ali nokuwitila mwisamba lya bulambo bwe lambo lyakoca pa mpongolo iye Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nokufumya yonse amafuta kuli cilume wa ŋombe ya mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi, elyo na mafuta ayatabilila ifya munda, nangufye conse icakambatilako kuli fyene, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "imfyo shonse shibili na mafuta yabako mupepi no musana, elyo na fyonse ifyalambatila ku libu, nafyo fine ali nokufifumisha kumo kwine ne mfyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pamo ngefyo bafumya amafuta ku mutuulo wa ŋombe yaocewa uwakwampana. Elyo shimapepo ali nokufyocela pa mulu wa bulambo bwe lambo lyakoca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba umukupo wakwa cilume wa ŋombe ne minofu yakwe, pamo pene no mutwe na molu yene, ifya munda pamo ne cifulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emukutila fyonse ifyashala kuli uyu cilume wa ŋombe, afibuule no kufifumisha kunse ya nkambi, ku cifulo icasangululwa, ico betilako imito no koca mu cininkwa ca mulilo pa mwina wa mito.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
