            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.22+NUM.15.23+NUM.15.24+NUM.15.25+NUM.15.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 15:22-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakuti ulukuta lonse ulwa bena Israeli lwacita icabubifi cimo mukukanaishiba ico Yawe alesha mu mafunde yakwe, nangufye ulukuta talwishibe umo umulandu ulolele, nalyo line mulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo ububifi bacitile bwaishibikwa, ulukuta luli nokuletafye iciponti ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. Bali nokumuleta kwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakalamba ba lukuta bali nokutambalika amaboko yabo pa mutwe wakwa cilume wa ŋombe pa cinso cakwa Yawe elyo nokumwipaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo shimapepo uwasubwa ali nokusendapo umulopa umo uwa cilume wa ŋombe mukati ke Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atumpike umunwe mu mulopa no kukana imiku cine lubali pa cinso cakwa Yawe kuntanshi ya cisalu icicinga ku muputule wamushilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umulopa umbi aushinge ku nsengo sha bulambo pa cinso cakwa Yawe mwi Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. Kabili umulopa uwashalapo ali nokuwitila mwisamba lya bulambo bwe lambo lyakoca pa mpongolo ye Tenti Lyakukumaninamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimapepo, ali nokufumya amafuta yonse kuli cilume wa ŋombe no kuyocela pa bulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyo alingile ukucita kuli cilume wa ŋombe uyu, nga fintu engacita kuli cilume wa ŋombe uwa mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. Iyi e nshila shimapepo ali nokutuulilamo ilambo lyakufuta pa fyabubifi fyabo, nabo bakelelwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo shimapepo ali nokufumisha cilume wa ŋombe kunse ya nkambi no kumoca nga fintu aocele cilume wa ŋombe uwantanshi. Kanshi uyu e mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi bwe bumba lyonse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga ni ntungulushi yabifya mukukanaishiba, yacita ifyo Yawe, Lesa wakwe alesha mu mafunde yakwe, ili no mulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico kanshi ngoyu mulandu acita waishibikwa kuli ena, ali nokuleta umutuulo wa mbushi iyilume iyabula akalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nokutambalika ukuboko kwakwe pa mutwe wa mbushi no kuipaila pa cinso cakwa Yawe pa ncende ye lambo lyakoca. Uyu e mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili shimapepo ali nokutumpika umunwe wakwe mu mulopa wa mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi, nokushinga ku nsengo sha ku bulambo bwe lambo lyakoca no kwitila umulopa uushele mwisamba lya bulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifi efyo alingile ukucita ukoca amafuta yonse pa bulambo pamo nga fintu engacita ku mafuta ya mutuulo wakwampana. Iyi e nshila shimapepo ali nokutuulilamo umutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi pa mulandu wa bubifi bwa iyi ntungulushi, nayo ikelelwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
