              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.15.27+NUM.15.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Imp 15:27-28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nga cakuti umuntu umo umwikalacalo abifya mukukanaishiba no kucita ifyo Yawe alesha mu mafunde yakwe, ali no mulandu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu muntu nga aishibishiwa ukuti nabifya, alingile ukuleta umutuulo wa pa bubifi acitile, imbushi iyikota iyabula akalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nokutambalika ukuboko kwakwe pa mutwe wa mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi no kwipaila pa ncende iyo bepailapo ilambo lyakoca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo shimapepo ali nokubuulapo umulopa ku munwe no kushinga ku nsengo sha bulambo bwe lambo lyakoca, kabili ali nokwitila umulopa ushelepo mwisamba lya bulambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali nokufumyako yonse amafuta, pamo ngefyo amafuta yafumishiwa ku mutuulo wakwampana, elyo shimapepo ali nokufyoca pa bulambo ngo mutuulo uwa cena cisuma icisekesha Yawe. Iyi e nshila shimapepo ali nokutuulilamo umutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi pa mulandu wa cabubifi cakwe, nao akelelwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
